ED | project=%s | trigger=%s | %s\",\n            project_id,\n            trigger,\n            exc,\n        )\n        # Fail silently \u2014 never block the user's workflow\n        return ProactiveCheck(\n            should_surface=False,\n            message=\"\",\n            trigger_type=trigger,\n        )\n"}}
