The `fetchJson` uses `${STUDIO_API_BASE}${path}`. When `STUDIO_API_BASE` is empty string `''`, the URL becomes just `/api/f51/studio/...` — a relative URL that goes through the Vite proxy. 

But `resolveStudioApiBase` falls back to `http://127.0.0.1:8010` when the env is empty. I need to fix this so an empty env means "use relative URLs":



